{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "09a3ddd5-fa6a-86c0-b815-1fc7072e782c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T14:30:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:28:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:28:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, hi Kevin, thank you for picking up. Um, I'm calling because my trash didn't get picked up, it's supposed to be Tuesday, well, today, and it's still sitting there. Is that okay? I mean, is that something you can fix?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let's take a look. What's the address where the pickup was missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 164 Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. I'm the landlord there, so I just, I want to make sure it's [line breaks up] taken care of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me a little there. 164 Ocean Avenue, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, 164 Ocean Avenue. Sorry, I'm in the car and the signal is bad. Can you hear me okay now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got you now. So the barrels were out this morning, and nobody came by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, they were out early, like before seven. Nobody came, and it's already after two. Is that normal? Is it okay if I just leave them out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, leave them at the curb. I'll note a missed pickup at 164 Ocean Avenue, Tuesday, and send it over to the crew. Sometimes the routes run late around the holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay, good. Um, is there a fee for that? For a second pickup or anything? I just don't want to get charged, is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no charge for a missed pickup. You're already covered. We just get the truck back out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a relief, thank you. I was worried. The kids are all at their father's this week, so nobody's even home to make more trash, but the tenants downstairs are, and I don't want it piling up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:30:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Keep them out, and if they're not picked up by tomorrow morning, call us back and we'll push it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow morning, okay. [inaudible] and that's fine to leave them out overnight, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I've got you down, 164 Ocean Avenue, missed Tuesday pickup, no fee. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you so much, Kevin, really. Have a good New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
